  <TR>
    <TD COLSPAN="4" STYLE="padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; text-align: justify">The undersigned, a shareholder of Brera Holdings PLC (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;), does hereby appoint and authorize Daniel Joseph McClory with the full power of substitution, to represent the undersigned and vote all of the Class A Ordinary Shares or Class B Ordinary Shares of the Company held of record as of the close of business on May 21, 2025 with all of the powers that the undersigned would possess if personally present, at the virtual Extraordinary General Meeting of Shareholders of the Company at 10:00 a.m. Eastern Daylight Time on June 14, 2025, online at: https://agm.issuerdirect.com/brea-egm-2025, or at any postponement or adjournment thereof. The undersigned hereby revokes all proxies previously given.</TD></TR>
