  <TR STYLE="background-color: #F3F3F3">
    <TD STYLE="width: 8%; border-left: Black 1pt solid; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; padding-top: 3pt; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>Proposal&nbsp;1</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 41%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; padding-top: 3pt; padding-bottom: 3pt; padding-left: 4.55pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 2%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Wingdings; font-size: 10pt">&agrave;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 6%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>FOR </B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 1%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; padding-right: 0.7pt; text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 8%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; padding-right: 0.7pt; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>WITHHOLD</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 1%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 8%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>ABSTAIN</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; width: 2%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; padding-left: 0.5in; text-indent: -0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 12%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; padding-left: 0.5in; text-align: right; text-indent: -0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 11%; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; border-right: Black 1pt solid; padding-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: -0.5in">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="padding-top: 3pt; padding-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; layout-grid-mode: line; font-weight: bold">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0.7pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">To approve a 1-for-10 reverse share split of the Company&rsquo;s ordinary shares, wherein the 50,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares of nominal value $0.005 each will be consolidated on a 1-for-10 basis into 5,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares of nominal value $0.05 each and the 250,000,000 Class B Ordinary Shares of nominal value $0.005 each will be consolidated on a 1-for-10 basis into 25,000,000 Class B Ordinary Shares of nominal value $0.05 each, to be effective as of 5:00 p.m. on June 25, 2025 (the &ldquo;Reverse Share Split&rdquo;).</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Wingdings; font-size: 10pt">&uml;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0.7pt; text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0.7pt; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Wingdings; font-size: 10pt">&uml;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Wingdings; font-size: 10pt">&uml;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; padding-left: 0.5in; text-indent: -0.5in">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 0.5in; text-align: right; text-indent: -0.5in"><FONT STYLE="text-transform: uppercase"><B>Control</B></FONT><B>&nbsp;ID:</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; text-indent: -0.5in">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="padding-top: 3pt; padding-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; layout-grid-mode: line; font-weight: bold">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; padding-right: 0.7pt; padding-left: 5.35pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 0.7pt; padding-left: 0.5in; text-align: center; layout-grid-mode: line; font-weight: bold">&nbsp;</TD>
